                                                "sense_id": "68da479a-cc86-33e6-871f-a78cae79c899",
                                                "text": "With the ring of light from his lantern dancing from side to side, he lurched across the yard, kicked off his boots at the back door, drew himself a last glass of beer from the barrel in the scullery, and made his way up to bed, where Mrs. Jones was already snoring."
